                    body: "### The Sacred Scarab Reimagined\n\nMetamorphosis represents change, transformation, and structural evolution. In our designs, the scarab is not a literal representation, but a geometric framework. It stands as a symbol of the transition from software code to physical bronze and silver.\n\n### Generative Metamorphosis\n\nWe design through variables—equations that define curves, ribs, and edges. Through this approach, form evolves dynamically. It is a digital metamorphosis that is subsequently petrified in noble metals through lost-wax casting, fusing algorithms with the heat of the crucible."
